id: pm-mlpn91
title: "OSSF Scorecard alert #29: qs denial-of-service advisories in the MCP Apps development dependency tree"
description: GitHub code-scanning alert #29 reports GHSA-4mjr-xmp4-gh2g and GHSA-x5fp-wj9c-mxmx on merged main ae63802. pnpm audit resolves qs 6.15.3 through @modelcontextprotocol/ext-apps -> @modelcontextprotocol/sdk -> express/body-parser. The maintained patched release is qs 6.16.0; a narrow pnpm override can update every compatible transitive edge while retaining the existing supply-chain and frozen-lockfile policy.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 0
tags[7]: denial-of-service,dependencies,dev-dependency,github-code-scanning,mcp,ossf-scorecard,security
created_at: "2026-09-02T21:17:07.092Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-02T22:19:05.647Z"
closed_at: "2026-09-02T22:19:05.076Z"
completed_at: "2026-09-02T22:19:05.076Z"
author: "harness:codex"
acceptance_criteria: "Govern qs through the narrow patched 6.x range; regenerate the deterministic lockfile; pnpm audit reports zero advisories at every severity; pnpm install --frozen-lockfile, security scans, static quality, and exact coverage pass; GitHub code-scanning alert #29 closes on the merged head."
parent: pm-qwoy
risk: high
confidence: high
reporter: GitHub OSSF Scorecard code scanning alert #29
severity: high
environment: Development dependency graph on main ae63802; qs 6.15.3 through MCP Apps SDK and Express
repro_steps: Query GitHub code-scanning alert 29 and run pnpm audit --json; observe GHSA-4mjr-xmp4-gh2g and GHSA-x5fp-wj9c-mxmx on qs 6.15.3.
resolution: "Added the >=6.16.0 <7.0.0 workspace override, regenerated the lockfile, and recorded passing isolated coverage receipt test-local-mtknr23h-jepje7."
expected_result: "Every resolved qs version is at least 6.16.0, pnpm audit has zero advisories, frozen lockfile install and repository gates pass, exact coverage has a canonical passing receipt, and the merged Scorecard scan retires alert #29."
actual_result: "All compatible paths resolve qs 6.16.0; pnpm audit reports zero advisories; frozen install, secret scan, and strict static quality pass. Isolated receipt test-local-mtknr23h-jepje7 records 61,262/61,262 statements, 46,281/46,281 branches, 12,742/12,742 functions, and 58,963/58,963 lines across 596 files and 8,307 tests. Hosted Scorecard closure remains a merge-SHA post-condition."
affected_version: qs@6.15.3
fixed_version: qs@6.16.0
component: pnpm-workspace.yaml and pnpm-lock.yaml MCP Apps development dependency graph
customer_impact: A known denial-of-service dependency remains in development tooling and causes the repository security posture to report an unresolved high-severity finding.
