comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-02T21:17:07.092Z","harness:codex","Duplicate-check evidence: exact all-status searches for both GHSA identifiers returned zero items. A broad qs/MCP/denial-of-service search found the closed brace-expansion dependency remediation pm-f5hy2n as the governing pattern, not a duplicate. GitHub Dependabot and secret-scanning queues are empty; OSSF Scorecard alert #29 is the sole native security alert."
  "2026-09-02T21:17:52.447Z","harness:codex","TDD remediation: before the override, pnpm audit reported both GHSA advisories and qs 6.15.3 on four MCP Apps SDK/Express paths. The narrow >=6.16.0 <7.0.0 override now resolves the same graph to qs 6.16.0; a frozen install succeeds and pnpm audit reports zero advisories across info, low, moderate, high, and critical."
  "2026-09-02T21:25:59.318Z","harness:codex","Verification correction: the linked full static run reached repository-static-quality and stopped at defect-evidence because its sandbox snapshot evaluated the four newly open intake defects before the linked-test run receipt existed. A direct source-workspace defect-evidence rerun is now clean: boundary 5/9 captured with 4 live waivers, 102 governed items, 106 classified items, and zero findings. This was tracker-evidence timing, not a dependency or source regression."
  "2026-09-02T21:53:44.621Z","harness:codex","Verification evidence: pnpm audit reports zero vulnerabilities at info, low, moderate, high, and critical; pnpm why qs resolves only 6.16.0; frozen installation and the tracked-secret scan pass. Exact coverage remains 61,262/61,262 statements, 46,281/46,281 branches, 12,742/12,742 functions, and 58,963/58,963 lines across 596 source files and 8,307 tests. The strict full-tracker static suite passed as machine receipt test-local-mtkmslut-wlk7qq. GitHub alert #29 is a hosted post-merge condition and will be checked against the merged head."
  "2026-09-02T22:18:53.153Z","harness:codex","Cubic review correction: isolated linked coverage receipt test-local-mtknr23h-jepje7 passed node scripts/run-tests.mjs coverage. Its captured stdout records 596 test files and 8,307 tests passing with the exact gate totals: 61,262/61,262 statements, 46,281/46,281 branches, 12,742/12,742 functions, and 58,963/58,963 lines."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-02T21:53:45.049Z","harness:codex",A narrow pnpm override bounded to the patched qs 6.x line remediates every compatible MCP Apps SDK/Express path without overriding direct package APIs; pair local audit proof with the post-merge Scorecard SARIF result because GitHub alerts are merge-SHA scoped.
